+///
+/// `std::process::Command` resolves a bare name like `az` to `az.exe` only: it
+/// neither walks `PATHEXT` nor falls back to `az.cmd`. Some CLIs ship only a
+/// batch launcher — Azure CLI's WinGet install has `az.cmd` plus an
