+// For blank line between elements, add extra \n
+write!(f, "\n{}\n", format_with_gutter(...))?;  // trailing \n creates blank line
+write!(f, "\n{}", hint_message(...))            // hint after blank line
+```
+
+**Don't add trailing `\n` to content:**

